# The gems globalid's tests load: activesupport and what it loads,
# activemodel for the models the tests locate, and railties with
# actionpack for the railtie's tests, and minitest-mock for the signed
# ids' tests. The suite's row loads cgi/escape first, since URI::GID calls
# CGI.unescape and the activesupport of the rails checkout loads no part of
# cgi before it. It loads test/helper.rb too, which railtie_test leaves to
# the files rake runs in the same process.
